nodecode-prompt-enhance is a rewrite of apoapostolov's apoapostolov/hermes-agent-awesome-plugins:

  https://github.com/apoapostolov/hermes-agent-awesome-plugins
  commit 953732a9fb52b6fd89e73fc96d910aab63163e07
